change(962,question='For an ideal uniform ADC with fixed full scale and a full-scale sinusoidal input, raising resolution from 8 to 10 bits improves quantization SNR by approximately:',reason='SNR≈6,02n+1,76 dB cho sinus full-scale; tăng 2 bit cho 12,04 dB≈12 dB.',tip='Ideal full-scale sine → 6,02 dB/bit.')
